{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>על כל דברי האגרת הזאת.</b> From the root of אגרה, as in קציר מאכלה; and the meaning is from the joining of the words." "<b>ומה ראו.</b> Because they saw wonders." "<b>ומה הגיע.</b> By means of the ears."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "He cites a biblical parallel for the root אגר (gather/reap); the reference appears to be to a phrase like that found in ancient harvest contexts."}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:24.935807523Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}